0.  Executive Summary

Progress on Ptolemy II continues. We have implemented the first version
of the type system. We have also ported Tycho to use Itcl 3.0, and
Tcl Blend to use JDK 1.2beta4. We have released a stand-alone version of
the Tycho slate, the first major modular release of a Tycho component
decoupled from the rest of Tycho. We have implemented a valued-FSM
capability in Ptolemy 0.7.1, which significantly improves the
expressiveness of our FSM (finite state machine) domain in combination
with other domains.


