Jie Liu has implemented a Scheduler and StaticSchedulingDirector class.
The Scheduler implements the MutationListener interface and registers
itself with the StaticSchedulingDirector so that it automatically
recomputes the schedule when topology mutations occur. The schedule is
cached, and any time it is requested, it is recomputed only if the
cached schedule has become invalid through mutations.

